        "detailed_description": "<h1>Community</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >English Localization in Progress!!!  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We want <strong>YOU</strong> to be part of the journey. We are inviting everyone to join our official Discord community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll have the chance to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Participate in early playtests</strong> of the English localization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share your feedback</strong> directly with the dev team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help us refine the game</strong> and shape its final form!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let’s solve these supernatural mysteries together. See you in the Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>English Localization in Progress!!!</strong> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are excited to share that the English version of <strong>The Occult Detective</strong> is officially under development!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Please stay tuned for more updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184990/extras/d789c86727ac6c60407207216b0cfdc6.avif?t=1768359020\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184990/extras_big/d789c86727ac6c60407207216b0cfdc6.avif?t=1768359020 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Occult Detective is a narrative-driven game blending rigorous logic of classic detective fiction with unsettling supernatural mysteries. You will be discovering vital clues in every case, diving into unscripted interrogations and uncovering truths that break minds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a rookie investigator for the A.I.B. (Agency of Investigating the Bizarre). Your job? To secure unknown artifacts, suppress forbidden powers, and solve murders that defy the laws of physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🗣️ Unscripted &amp; AI-Driven Interrogations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of linear games where you just click until you find the &quot;one true evidence&quot;? We break the rigid structure by integrating large language models (LLMs) to power our NPC dialogue.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate at your own pace:</strong> Collect evidence and connect clues freely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk Directly to Suspects:</strong> Question every suspect in a truly unscripted manner using natural language (text input).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Logic vs. Lie:</strong> Your goal is to use physical evidence to push their personalized defenses, not just click through pre-written dialogue trees. You lead the interrogation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>👁️ Even Anomalies Leave Traces</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to this world touched by mysterious secrets. Here, shadow organizations safeguard relics of lost gods, while desperate souls in the city’s underbelly whisper of forbidden rituals. As an investigator, you must untangle a web of mysteries where the suspects may not be entirely human, but the motive is always grounded in cold, hard logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184990/extras/93548f5bca332257cf6248a82bca1259.poster.avif?t=1768359020\" width=726 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184990/extras/93548f5bca332257cf6248a82bca1259.webm?t=1768359020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184990/extras/93548f5bca332257cf6248a82bca1259.mp4?t=1768359020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔍 Deduction Above All</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We focus on <strong>&quot;New Orthodox Mystery&quot;</strong> where deduction is paramount. Even in a world of supernatural abilities, the rules of deduction still apply. You must reconstruct the crime scene, understand the specific &quot;rules&quot; of the artifacts involved, and expose the killer through pure reasoning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184990/extras/540a6f6dd6c994173d1f211af8e897bb.poster.avif?t=1768359020\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184990/extras/540a6f6dd6c994173d1f211af8e897bb.webm?t=1768359020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📚 A Sprawling 400k-Word Saga</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a deep dive. With over <strong>400,000 words</strong> of intricate storytelling, <strong>The Occult Detective</strong> offers a dense visual novel experience filled with hidden secrets and unforgettable characters. Every conversation matters. Every text log counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's time to see the world for what it truly is. Your investigation begins NOW.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>English Localization in Progress!!!</strong> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are excited to share that the English version of <strong>The Occult Detective</strong> is officially under development!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Please stay tuned for more updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184990/extras/d789c86727ac6c60407207216b0cfdc6.avif?t=1768359020\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184990/extras_big/d789c86727ac6c60407207216b0cfdc6.avif?t=1768359020 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Occult Detective is a narrative-driven game blending rigorous logic of classic detective fiction with unsettling supernatural mysteries. You will be discovering vital clues in every case, diving into unscripted interrogations and uncovering truths that break minds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a rookie investigator for the A.I.B. (Agency of Investigating the Bizarre). Your job? To secure unknown artifacts, suppress forbidden powers, and solve murders that defy the laws of physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🗣️ Unscripted &amp; AI-Driven Interrogations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of linear games where you just click until you find the &quot;one true evidence&quot;? We break the rigid structure by integrating large language models (LLMs) to power our NPC dialogue.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate at your own pace:</strong> Collect evidence and connect clues freely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk Directly to Suspects:</strong> Question every suspect in 