ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184990/extras/540a6f6dd6c994173d1f211af8e897bb.poster.avif?t=1768359020\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184990/extras/540a6f6dd6c994173d1f211af8e897bb.webm?t=1768359020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📚 A Sprawling 400k-Word Saga</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a deep dive. With over <strong>400,000 words</strong> of intricate storytelling, <strong>The Occult Detective</strong> offers a dense visual novel experience filled with hidden secrets and unforgettable characters. Every conversation matters. Every text log counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's time to see the world for what it truly is. Your investigation begins NOW.</strong></p>",
